// Bass Guitar: part of dawsome-kit, written by build.py.
// From Karoryfer Fashionbass, its notes and clean mapping (fingers, neck pickup), at a pinned commit; CC0-1.0, see set.json.
// Uses only the SFZ opcodes Dawsome reads; keys are MIDI numbers (C4 = 60).

